l United States. Under the Secure Flight Final Rule, TSA will require airlines to collect and send to TSA the following information: · Full Name (required)  · Date of Birth (required)  · Gender (required)  Passengers are only required to provide their full name, date of birth, and gender to allow TSA to perform watch list
